        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "8. It is a settled principle of law, that it is not necessary for a person, to be convicted under Section 414 of the Indian Penal Code, some other person must be traced out for being convicted for the offence of committing theft."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "3e47ebd39dfb4a088f79bda7fa43d2de_24",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
